      "content": "We want an aggregate TF-to-gene PANDA network for 130 pancreatic tumours, using the human motif and PPI priors in our lab folder. The gene-by-sample matrix came from a shared drive, and I'm not certain whether its values are gene expression levels or somatic mutation counts."
