      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Are the values in the gene-by-sample matrix gene expression levels?\n  You wrote: \"I'm not certain whether its values are gene expression levels or somatic mutation counts\". PANDA's contract: \"PANDA consumes a gene-by-sample expression matrix plus motif and PPI priors, or a validated adjusted gene-by-gene co-expression matrix through coexpression_file\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
